After playing real life nethack for a while (metaphor), can hardly
resist the urge to go back to the pleasures of nethacking and
sourcenethacking, and since a new version seems to be due, I`d like to
propose to your always benevolent consideration YACC: The Gentleman,
much in the tradition of the Tourist and the Archeologist. (more a
draft than a complete proposal, tho).

This gentleman has a Quest: to find the Crown Jewels. Then he can shop
for almost nothing, (like in the `he has a billion dollars check! he
can take whatever he wants), before returning it to the legitimate
owner.
He has a high charisma and dexterity and can recognize booze right
away.
His preferred weapon? The cane! It grants him superior ability to
discover traps and hidden doors and to escape pits in a breeze,
besides being available in several materials, even magical style. He
is good too with darts and swords, though his particular advantage is
the handshake, an uncanny attack that lets him pacify monsters and
maybe even befriend them in the act. He is very civilized and wins
quickly the favor of good and civilized characters, though  evil ones,
well, will try to utterly humiliate him by, perhaps, chewing him for a
while? And of course has a natural ability to horses and dogs.
Certainly, he is a skeptic, so his relation to the gods is, well,
problematic, but he is well balanced and neutral regarding alignments.
Magic does not come easily to him and genocide is abhorrent, but his
wide readings allow him to distinguish right away scrolls of magic
mapping and identify...
His seriousness impedes him to hallucinate, but unfortunately his
tastes doesn`t allow him to taste but the most natural and healthy
foods available.
He may wear several acesories: glasses, monocle, hat, wallet, pipe...
In sum, a character for players with style...

